.claude/

# research harnesses, manuscripts and figures stay off the public repository
research/
docs/PERFORMANCE.md
docs/PARTICLE-FILTER.md
docs/figs/

# the sandbox: a user's own models and runs, never the production path
sandbox/

# FluBNF.app's Python host: compiled per machine by scripts/macos/build_app_host.sh
